{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1d4abd5f-7ca5-4d31-9fc4-734c28513b44",
    "name": "CRUD Lab - Starter",
    "description": "Student Enrollment API - CRUD testing lab.\n\n1. Start the server: python student_api.py\n2. Collection variable baseUrl = http://localhost:3000 (build 1.0).\n3. Send 'Reset test data' first.\n4. Add your requests + Post-response tests to the Read, Update and Delete folders (and more to Create).\n5. When everything passes on build 1.0, change baseUrl to http://localhost:3001 (build 1.1), reset, and run again. Every failing test is a defect report.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Reset test data",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reset",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reset"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Restores Alice (1001), Bob (1002), Chen (1003). Send this before each test run."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 Create",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "C-ex  Create student with invalid age (15)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/students",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "students"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": 2001,\n  \"name\": \"Bob\",\n  \"age\": 15\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Expected output: 400 Bad Request",
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "",
                  "// The error response should explain what went wrong",
                  "pm.test(\"Error message mentions age\", () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.include(\"age\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "C-ex  (postcondition) No student 2001 was created",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/students/2001",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "students",
                "2001"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Postcondition: the rejected student must NOT be in the database",
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 404\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Worked example from the test-case table. Add your own Create tests below it."
    },
    {
      "name": "2 Read",
      "item": [],
      "description": "Add at least 2 Read tests."
    },
    {
      "name": "3 Update",
      "item": [],
      "description": "Add at least 2 Update tests."
    },
    {
      "name": "4 Delete",
      "item": [],
      "description": "Add at least 2 Delete tests."
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    }
  ]
}